  "question": {
    "text": "An inductor $(L=100 \\mathrm{mH})$, a resistor $(R=100 \\Omega)$ and a battery $(E=100 \\mathrm{~V})$ are initially connected in series as shown in the figure. After a long time the battery is disconnected after short circuiting the points $A$ and $B$. The current in the circuit $1 \\mathrm{~mm}$ after the circuit is\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/FQn0T060PhgUkuEXuQitV5Y2t_zBXcXiPLODOPc-DRk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
